# Boards: 'stuff' is tinted with the building's stuff colour, so wood reads as wood and steel as steel.
newmtl stuff
Kd 1.000 1.000 1.000
map_Kd IsoRim/Swatches/{stuff}

# Frame: still a 'stuff' material, so it follows the building's material too, darkened to 0.60.
newmtl stuff_frame
Kd 0.600 0.600 0.600
map_Kd IsoRim/Swatches/{stuff}
